Package: navien-dash
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Eric Dynowski <eric@dynowski.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= @PYMIN@), python3 (<< @PYNEXT@), systemd, udev
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/brokebit/navien-240a2
Description: live monitor for a Navien NPE-240A2 cascade on RS-485
 Passive, receive-only reader of the RS-485 bus shared by cascaded Navien
 NPE-240A2 tankless water heaters. Decodes every frame, keeps a short live
 history and a rotated raw log, and serves a JSON API (and, in later
 releases, a live dashboard) on port 8000.
 .
 Ships its own Python virtualenv in /opt/navien-dash, built against the
 system python3 of the build host.
